1 empty cleanup: 0
2 zero: cleanup intervalMs must be a positive finite number
3 negative: cleanup intervalMs must be a positive finite number
4 nan: cleanup intervalMs must be a positive finite number
5 infinite: cleanup intervalMs must be a positive finite number
6 ok: no throw (object)
7 stop before start is a no-op: ok
8 cleanup again: 0
